        "type": "stack"
      }
    }
  },
  "blocks": {
    "start-goal": {
      "id": "start-goal",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "start-goal-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "目标：为每人 30 元的午餐预算比较两种方案。先读价格，再算合计与余额；完成后，你会拥有一页自己的方案，而不是一份只读功能清单。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "start-goal-p2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "请在工作台打开本讲。网页阅读页可查看内容和步骤，但页面复制、正文编辑、讲稿与历史操作在工作台的文档编辑入口使用。本文默认不配音，打开或改字不会请求语音合成。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "start-route": {
      "id": "start-route",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "start-route-list",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "start-route-item1",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "start-route-line1",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "在页面栏找到“午餐预算：先读价格，再算合计”，把它作为练习材料。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "start-route-item2",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "start-route-line2",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "先复制这一页并撤消、恢复，再改副本的价格与合计。原来的材料保留作对照。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "start-route-item3",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "start-route-line3",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "用工具栏的“本步字幕 / 讲稿”打开旁栏，编辑本步讲稿并核对播放时机。纯文字页也有这个入口。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "start-route-item4",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "start-route-line4",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "看见保存状态确认后刷新并重新打开，确认你的正文、讲稿和时机仍在。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "budget-question": {
      "id": "budget-question",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "budget-question-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "每人预算 30 元。主食、配菜与饮品各选一份，如何检查是否超支？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "budget-table": {
      "id": "budget-table",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "budget-price-table",
          "type": "table",
          "headerRows": 1,
          "columnWidths": [
            180,
            100
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "budget-row-0",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "budget-cell-0-0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "项目"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "budget-cell-0-1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "价格（¥）"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "budget-row-1",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "budget-cell-1-0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "主食"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "budget-cell-1-1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "12"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "budget-row-2",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "budget-cell-2-0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "配菜"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "budget-cell-2-1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "8"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "budget-row-3",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "budget-cell-3-0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "饮品"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "budget-cell-3-1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "5"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "budget-method": {
      "id": "budget-method",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "budget-method-list",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "budget-method-item1",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "budget-method-line1",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "先估算：12 + 8 接近 20，再加 5，应该小于 30。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "budget-method-item2",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "budget-method-line2",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "再精算：12 + 8 + 5 = 25。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "budget-method-item3",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "budget-method-line3",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "检查余额：30 − 25 = 5，预算内还剩 5 元。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "budget-conclusion": {
      "id": "budget-conclusion",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "budget-conclusion-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "结论：原方案合计 25 元，剩余 5 元。比较方案时，保留价格明细，才能解释差额来自哪里。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "budget-details": {
      "id": "budget-details",
      "type": "container",
      "layout": "stack",
      "children": [
        "budget-table",
        "budget-method"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "title": "价格与计算过程"
      }
    },
    "copy-actions": {
      "id": "copy-actions",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "copy-actions-list",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "copy-actions-item1",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "copy-actions-line1",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "打开页面栏，在“午餐预算：先读价格，再算合计”右侧的更多菜单选择“复制页面”。副本紧接在原页后面。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "copy-actions-item2",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "copy-actions-line2",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "暂时不要改正文。点工具栏“撤消”，检查整页副本被移除；再点“恢复”，检查副本及其步骤和讲稿一起回来。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "copy-actions-item3",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "copy-actions-line3",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "用副本的更多菜单重命名为“午餐方案 B”。在副本表格中把配菜的 8 改成 10。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "copy-actions-item4",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "copy-actions-line4",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "把副本计算过程和结论改为：12 + 10 + 5 = 27，30 − 27 = 3。回到原页，核对它仍是 25 元与 5 元。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "copy-boundary": {
      "id": "copy-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "copy-boundary-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "复制得到独立的正文、步骤和讲稿，图片与组件定义等素材继续共享。批注是原位置的讨论，留在原内容上，不会新增一份副本讨论。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "copy-boundary-p2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "新增页用页面栏加号；重命名、复制、上下移动和删除在页级更多中。移动保留绑定，删除会说明关联内容并检查引用。最后一页删除后保留为空页；拖动页面重排尚未实现。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scripts-actions": {
      "id": "scripts-actions",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "scripts-actions-list",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "scripts-actions-item1",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "scripts-actions-line1",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "在页面栏选择“午餐方案 B”（或原练习页），点顶部“本步字幕 / 讲稿”图标，旁栏标题下应显示所选页与“第 1 / 2 步”。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "scripts-actions-item2",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "scripts-actions-line2",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "第一步有两段讲稿。把第一段“配菜八元”改成“配菜十元”，保留已有发音标记与暂停提示；在“发音”操作中可分别检查显示文字与读音。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "scripts-actions-item3",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "scripts-actions-line3",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点旁栏“下一步”，把第二步的总额与余额改成二十七元和三元。再回到上一步，检查两步仍是各自的内容。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "scripts-actions-item4",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "scripts-actions-line4",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "保持讲稿旁栏打开，回正文补一句“方案 B 多花 2 元”。等待保存，刷新重开：表格、正文和讲稿都应保留。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "scripts-scope": {
      "id": "scripts-scope",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "scripts-scope-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "没有动画、没有讲稿的普通页或空页也能使用顶部同一入口。空字段首次输入才建立本步讲稿，正文不会被自动复制进讲稿。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "scripts-scope-p2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "带动画的示例还可在动画卡片的字幕图标就地展开同一份讲稿。可去“讲稿与制作”的“本步讲稿、发音与动作提示”一页比较两种入口；它们不维护第二份字幕。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "timing-actions": {
      "id": "timing-actions",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "timing-actions-list",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "timing-actions-item1",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "timing-actions-line1",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "选择午餐练习页第一步，在讲稿旁栏找到“配音开始”“最短停留（毫秒）”“结束停顿（毫秒）”。本例应显示本页继承的 1200 与 250。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "timing-actions-item2",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "timing-actions-line2",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "第一步两段讲稿原有不同开始时机。点“统一本步时机”，再选择“动画后”，把最短停留改为 1800，结束停顿改为 300。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "timing-actions-item3",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "timing-actions-line3",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "切到第二步，再回来，检查第一步的明确设置仍在。点“恢复本步继承”：本步字段回到页面的 1200 / 250，两段讲稿的不同开始时机重新显现。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "timing-actions-item4",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "timing-actions-line4",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "在最短停留里输入一个单独的负号，再移开焦点：错误明确写着“未采用”，负号不会成为文稿中的毫秒数。请把它改为有效数值，或点“恢复本步继承”后再放映。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "timing-intent": {
      "id": "timing-intent",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "timing-intent-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "“同步动画 / 动画后”与两项毫秒值是讲授制作意图，不等于已经有配音。本讲没有生成音频，纯文字步骤也没有可等待的动画。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "timing-intent-p2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "要对照有时长的真实场景，请打开“讲稿与制作”的“随动画讲，或动画结束后再讲”。编辑会先暂停相关预览与试听；局部动画播放不伪装为有声讲授。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "comments-actions": {
      "id": "comments-actions",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "comments-actions-list",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "comments-actions-item1",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "comments-actions-line1",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "在方案 B 的结论中选择“3 元”，使用原生批注入口写下“能否在不超预算的条件下再加一份配菜？”。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "comments-actions-item2",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "comments-actions-line2",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点顶部批注图标查看线程。选区来自同一个正文编辑器，可跨段；讨论内容和原位置一起保存。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "comments-actions-item3",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "comments-actions-line3",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "在正文输入一句临时说明，立即用撤消恢复，再用恢复重做。讲稿字段内的撤消作用于该字段；页面结构修改可从文档历史撤回。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "comments-actions-item4",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "comments-actions-line4",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "等待“已保存”后打开版本历史，查看真实记录。若出现保存冲突或恢复草稿提示，先核对当前文稿，再选择重试或明确放弃该草稿。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "comments-agent": {
      "id": "comments-agent",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "comments-agent-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "不需要模型也能编辑、批注、保存和预览。AI 助手需要你自己的真实模型配置；批注存在不表示已自动发送给助手，批量发送与统一审阅也不能当成已经完成的流程。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "delivery-purpose": {
      "id": "delivery-purpose",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "delivery-purpose-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "先回到方案 B，核对价格、合计、余额与本步讲稿是一致的。保存状态确认的是编辑文稿；放映和导出使用另行编译的版本。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "delivery-actions": {
      "id": "delivery-actions",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "delivery-actions-list",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "delivery-actions-item1",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "delivery-actions-line1",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点“放映预览”会明确准备当前已保存文稿；先处理输入法组字、保存错误或尚未采用的时机输入。准备期间正文仍可继续编辑，后来输入会使旧编译结果失效。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "delivery-actions-item2",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "delivery-actions-line2",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "放映标题显示“当前保存版本”时，任意选择第一步、第二步，再回第一步，检查结论按步骤显示与隐藏。若文稿已更新，点“重新编译”图标准备新版；回到文档仍能继续编辑原内容。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "delivery-actions-item3",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "delivery-actions-line3",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点顶部“导出”图标打开“文档导出”面板，选择网站或 Notebook。出现“正在确认文稿保存…”时可取消本次导出准备，正文保存仍会继续；只有源保存确认后才提交生成任务。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "delivery-next": {
      "id": "delivery-next",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "delivery-next-p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "更多已实现能力按主题放在其它导览：正文排版、代码运行、课堂互动、动画、可选执行环境和联网资源分别展开。外部服务、设备和网络的前提写在各页，未准备的能力不会用假数据代替。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "delivery-version": {
      "id": "delivery-version",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "delivery-version-meaning",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "生成记录会说明“文稿保存版本相同”或“与当前编辑版本不同”，旧记录没有版本时显示“未记录保存版本”。它们比较的是文稿保存版本，不表示外部素材、代码和附件已经形成不可变的历史包。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "delivery-audio-boundary",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本练习的文字与 Notebook 不需要语音服务。当前文档没有完整的音色、配音任务或视频制作入口；真实服务、录制权限与媒体裁切等条件请看“讲稿与制作”的明确说明。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
